  "title": "WebGPU Motion Blur",
  "description": "Per-object motion blur from a velocity MRT, set up with useRenderPipeline. An animated character and spinning tori show the effect; toggle it and tune the amount from Leva. Based on three.js webgpu_postprocessing_motion_blur.",
